<title>HUNGARY: Primagaz plans 17.5 pct dividend on 1996.</title>
<headline>Primagaz plans 17.5 pct dividend on 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian gas distributor Primagaz Rt said on Friday it would propose its shareholders the payout of a 17.5 percent dividend or 175 forints per share on 1996 results.</p>
<p>The company paid a 15 percent dividend last year.</p>
<p>Primagaz, which will hold its annual shareholders' meeting on April 18, posted an IAS audited after-tax profit of 1.57 billion forints on sales of 17.63 billion in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
